<title>DUBAI: Saudi crown prince receives Spain's Matutes.</title>
<headline>Saudi crown prince receives Spain's Matutes.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Crown Prince Abdullah on Wednesday received Spanish Foreign Minister Abel Matutes, the official Saudi news agency said.</p>
<p>It gave no further details of the meeting that was attended by Saudi Foreign Minister Prince Saud al-Faisal and other officials.</p>
</text>
